{"id":"n43832-1-23","stage":1,"title":"문 · 门","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n43832-1-23-1","ko":"추운데 문을 닫는 것이 어떨까요?","zh":"这么冷，把门关上怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"추운데","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문을","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닫는","meaning":"关，盖，合","explanation":"닫다：关，盖，合；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"닫다","audio":"/audio/b9f8f7c9bcb83cea095f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57289","senseId":"1","lemma":"닫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떨까요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"e2c7d5c49b61f532","term":"문","zh":"门","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"b9f8f7c9bcb83cea","term":"닫다","zh":"关，盖，合","audio":"/audio/b9f8f7c9bcb83cea095f.mp3","entryId":"57289","definition":"把门、盖子、抽屉等挪到原位置，防止打开。","pronunciation":["닫따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d3f0857a478010da29c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n43832-1-23-2","ko":"아, 네 문이 열려 있는 줄 몰랐어요.","zh":"啊，我没注意到门是开着的呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문이","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열려","meaning":"开","explanation":"열리다：开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"열리다","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74352","senseId":"1","lemma":"열리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰랐어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成